	(text "Power: Nucleo 3V3 -> TPS22917 load switch (BT_EN) -> VBAT_IN and VDD_IO (module accepts 3.0-4.2 V, all I/O at 3.3 V logic). Switching BT_3V3 on boots the module (auto power-on circuit on SYS_CTRL).\nOptional USB-C feeds VCHG (USB VBUS) for firmware update / USB debug; while VCHG is present the module stays powered."
